31
00:01:19,944 --> 00:01:20,457
property.

32
00:01:21,258 --> 00:01:23,855
So all the class properties are not managed

33
00:01:23,887 --> 00:01:26,644
by your methods. Instead, they probably are

34
00:01:26,772 --> 00:01:29,401
public and can be used from outside the

35
00:01:29,401 --> 00:01:29,785
class.

36
00:01:30,859 --> 00:01:32,719
Then in the end, you would just have a data

37
00:01:32,719 --> 00:01:35,668
