00:01:47,849 --> 00:01:51,183
a data container utility methods. Otherwise,

44
00:01:51,199 --> 00:01:52,145
you wanna avoid this.

45
00:01:53,299 --> 00:01:54,710
The goal, of course, is

46
00:01:55,463 --> 00:01:56,778
